WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.584
This phone runs in your browser.

2
00:00:02.584 --> 00:00:04.016
You installed nothing.

3
00:00:04.016 --> 00:00:11.375
By the end, you will have tapped a shop on Android and iOS, tested a payment, and watched a bad update roll back.

4
00:00:12.975 --> 00:00:15.794
Open shipvo.dev/playground.

5
00:00:15.794 --> 00:00:18.614
A shop called Tide and Tackle appears.

6
00:00:18.614 --> 00:00:20.394
Tap Add on two products.

7
00:00:20.394 --> 00:00:22.175
The cart says two items.

8
00:00:23.775 --> 00:00:27.200
Select iOS, and the same app shows on an iPhone.

9
00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:29.055
Select Android to go back.

10
00:00:29.055 --> 00:00:31.409
Now try dark mode and large text.

11
00:00:31.409 --> 00:00:33.050
The app stays readable.

12
00:00:36.775 --> 00:00:39.711
Real phones know where they are, and can pay.

13
00:00:39.711 --> 00:00:41.146
You choose the answer.

14
00:00:41.146 --> 00:00:43.038
Pick Lisbon for the location.

15
00:00:43.038 --> 00:00:44.343
Approve the payment.

16
00:00:44.343 --> 00:00:45.779
Turn airplane mode on.

17
00:00:45.779 --> 00:00:47.475
The app shows each choice.

18
00:00:49.775 --> 00:00:51.007
Now the hard part.

19
00:00:51.007 --> 00:00:52.651
Publish a signed update.

20
00:00:52.651 --> 00:00:54.568
Shipvo checks the signature.

21
00:00:54.568 --> 00:00:58.060
It goes to a tenth of cohorts, then to all of them.

22
00:00:58.060 --> 00:00:58.950
Now crash it.

23
00:00:58.950 --> 00:01:00.798
Three starts in a row fail.

24
00:01:00.798 --> 00:01:04.975
On the fourth, the phone goes back to version one, by itself.

25
00:01:06.775 --> 00:01:08.377
Last, add more phones.

26
00:01:08.377 --> 00:01:11.289
Pick up to twelve, Android, iOS or both.

27
00:01:11.289 --> 00:01:15.075
Copy the link, and whoever opens it sees your setup.

28
00:01:18.775 --> 00:01:22.686
That is a phone, a payment and a rollback, with no install.

29
00:01:22.686 --> 00:01:25.536
Try it at shipvo.dev/playground.

30
00:01:25.536 --> 00:01:28.850
Next, see your own app on a phone with shipvo run.
